# .NET standards

Apply `coding-standards` references: `naming.md`, `coding.md`, plus `api-services.md` or `background-services.md` by project type.

Hard requirements: nullable aware; async all the way; thin controllers; XML docs on public APIs; Conventional Commits on save/PR.
